ign_left  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_description\"><p>In Green Cycle, players step into the role of recycling managers, competing to process waste efficiently and sustainably.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>The goal? Maximize resource management while learning the importance of recycling.</strong></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_1 abt-title1-sec9  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_description\"><p>Each turn offers strategic decisions: load containers, assign transports, or recycle cards from the center or your own play area. But be careful! Containers follow strict rules and accept only one type of waste, while transports have unique loading restrictions.</p>\n<p>The game ends when the last transport is fully loaded, and the player who managed their resources most effectively will emerge victorious!</p>\n<p>Green Cycle combines strategic thinking and environmental awareness to create a fun and educational recycling experience.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_row_inner et_pb_row_inner_1\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_inner et_pb_column_inner_1 et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_code et_pb_code_0\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_code_inner\"><style>\n:root {--abtcolor-1: #1cb57e; }\n.abt-btn-sec9,.abt-mntlt-s